    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Early Access] Orbcraft Survivors is currently in development.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New content and updates will continue to be added \u2014 we welcome your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbcraft Survivors</strong> is a <strong>time survival game</strong> with <strong>roguelite elements</strong>, where you craft orbs and enhance them with powerful perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge the\u00a0same orb</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0enhance it into\u00a0a stronger form, and\u00a0<strong>acquire, combine, and apply perks</strong>\u00a0to maximize\u00a0your power. Try\u00a0different combinations\u00a0to unleash\u00a0<strong>overwhelming magic</strong>\u00a0and survive\u00a0the oncoming waves\u00a0of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/816b56b50359e059bf575b70c6687b4c.avif?t=1753108538\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character\u00a0can equip up\u00a0to\u00a0<strong>6 or more\u00a0orbs</strong>, each\u00a0possessing a\u00a0unique skill. Merge orbs to\u00a0make them stronger, and\u00a0<strong>unleash Level\u00a03 orbs</strong>\u00a0to dominate\u00a0the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.poster.avif?t=1753108538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.webm?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.mp4?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/d9627992a3a3abd3b849c7f0d1ec149f.avif?t=1753108538\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0<strong>over 100 perk\u00a0combinations</strong>\u00a0available, every\u00a0battle brings\u00a0fresh strategies\u00a0and creativity. Discover powerful\u00a0synergies and\u00a0<strong>test your luck\u00a0and tactics</strong>\u00a0for\u00a0a unique experience\u00a0in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.poster.avif?t=1753108538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.webm?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.mp4?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/47e7c13993540c11e683de3c549d60b2.avif?t=1753108538\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield each\u00a0character\u2019s unique\u00a0skills</strong>\u00a0at the\u00a0right moment. Gather gold\u00a0to unlock\u00a0<strong>powerful talents</strong>\u00a0and enhance\u00a0your character\u2019s potential. Invest\u00a0wisely, break\u00a0your limits, and\u00a0become the last\u00a0survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.poster.avif?t=1753108538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.webm?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.mp4?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Early Access] Orbcraft Survivors is currently in development.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New content and updates will continue to be added \u2014 we welcome your feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orbcraft Survivors</strong> is a <strong>time survival game</strong> with <strong>roguelite elements</strong>, where you craft orbs and enhance them with powerful perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge the\u00a0same orb</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0enhance it into\u00a0a stronger form, and\u00a0<strong>acquire, combine, and apply perks</strong>\u00a0to maximize\u00a0your power. Try\u00a0different combinations\u00a0to unleash\u00a0<strong>overwhelming magic</strong>\u00a0and survive\u00a0the oncoming waves\u00a0of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/816b56b50359e059bf575b70c6687b4c.avif?t=1753108538\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character\u00a0can equip up\u00a0to\u00a0<strong>6 or more\u00a0orbs</strong>, each\u00a0possessing a\u00a0unique skill. Merge orbs to\u00a0make them stronger, and\u00a0<strong>unleash Level\u00a03 orbs</strong>\u00a0to dominate\u00a0the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.poster.avif?t=1753108538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.webm?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/6a49b96119a0712e3c3d32e7e4fd514f.mp4?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/d9627992a3a3abd3b849c7f0d1ec149f.avif?t=1753108538\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With\u00a0<strong>over 100 perk\u00a0combinations</strong>\u00a0available, every\u00a0battle brings\u00a0fresh strategies\u00a0and creativity. Discover powerful\u00a0synergies and\u00a0<strong>test your luck\u00a0and tactics</strong>\u00a0for\u00a0a unique experience\u00a0in every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.poster.avif?t=1753108538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.webm?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/c9f19c5f3826eaef4cfc12457a5b0c8d.mp4?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/47e7c13993540c11e683de3c549d60b2.avif?t=1753108538\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield each\u00a0character\u2019s unique\u00a0skills</strong>\u00a0at the\u00a0right moment. Gather gold\u00a0to unlock\u00a0<strong>powerful talents</strong>\u00a0and enhance\u00a0your character\u2019s potential. Invest\u00a0wisely, break\u00a0your limits, and\u00a0become the last\u00a0survivor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.poster.avif?t=1753108538\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.webm?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3327240/extras/b104e8d16f8a2f13f7b8e20789f9ec09.mp4?t=1753108538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
